w-up invitation. ",r(d[6]).universityName," stores this contact information only to send these invitations and evaluate their success. You may unsubscribe from future invitations using the instructions in those messages. You may also contact us at privacy VECOSPACE.com to request that we remove this information from our database."]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:["MemberContent-:"," ",(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"We may receive information about you when you or another member uploadphoto or posts other content to the Platform. For further details about the rights over this information available to individuals."})]}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:["Information from Other Third-Party Sources-:"," ",(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["In order to provide you with more tailored recommendations, we may obtain information about you from publicly and commercially available sources and other third parties as permitted by law. For more information about the data that we obtain from these providers, please contact us at privacy@",r(d[6]).universityName,".com."]})]}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"2. Use of Information"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"2.1 Operating our Platform"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"We may use information about you for various purposes related to operating our Platform, including to:"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"1. Provide, maintain, and improve our Platform, including to process transactions, develop new products and services, and manage the performance of our Platform;"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"2. Display information about you, for instance, your list of interests, which will be visible on your profile;"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"3. Personalize the Platform, for example, to suggest content in which we think you may be interested (including content given special protection under EU law or that relates to sensitive topics such as health, political opinions, religion, and sexual identity);"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"4. Provide you with better recommendations;"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"5. Monitor and analyse trends, usage, and activities in connection with our Platform; and"}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["6. Detect, investigate, and prevent fraudulent transactions, abuse, and other illegal activities; to protect the rights, property, or safety of ",r(d[6]).universityName," and others; to enforce compliance with our policies; and to comply with applicable law and government requests."]}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"7.Perform accounting and administrative tasks and enforce or manage legal claims."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"2.2 Communicatingwith You "}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"We may use information about you for various purposes related to communicating with you, including to:"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"1.Respond to your comments, questions, and requests, and provide customer service;"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"2.Communicate with you, in accordance with your account settings, about products, services, and events offered by us and others, to provide news and information that we think will be of interest to you, to conduct online surveys, to contact you about events on our Platform that are being held near your location, and to otherwise communicate with you in accordance with Section 2.3;"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"3.Notify you about communications of other members, in accordance with the communication preferences that you indicate in your account; and customer service;"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"4.Send you technical notices, updates, security alerts and support, and administrative messages."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"2.3 Advertising and Other Uses "}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"We may use information about you for various other purposes, including to:"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"1.Provide content, features, or sponsorships that match member profiles or interests;"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"2.Facilitate contests and other promotions;"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"3.Combine with information that we collect for the purposes described in this Privacy Policy; and"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"4.Carry out any other purposes described to you at the time that we collected the information."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"2.4 Legal Basis for Processing "}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"Our legal basis for collecting and using the information described above will depend on the type of information and the specific context in which we collect it."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"1.We process information about you to provide our services in accordance with our Terms of Service, for example to allow you to join groups, or to display your profile to other members, and to allow us to send you important service updates."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"2.We also process information about you where it is in our legitimate interests to do so and not overridden by your rights (for example, in some cases for direct marketing, fraud prevention, network and information systems security, responding to your communications, the operation of networks of groups by the network administrators, and improving our Platform)."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"3.Sometimes you provide us with sensitive information about you; for instance, the mere fact of joining a certain group may indicate information about your health, religion, political views, or sexual identity. Joining such groups or posting information on the Platform about these topics is entirely voluntarily and done with your explicit consent."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"4.In some cases, we may also have a legal obligation to collect information about you or may otherwise need the information to protect your vital interests or those of another person."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"5.We may also process information to comply with a legal requirement or to perform a contract."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"3. Sharing of Information "}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"3.1 Through Our Platform"}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["We share some of the information that we collect by displaying it on our Platform according to your member profile and account settings. Some information, such as user name, is always public. Some information, such as interests, is public by default, but can be hidden on our Platform. Some information, such as group memberships, will always be visible to other members of that ",r(d[6]).universityName," ","group, and may be public, depending on the settings of that group. We recommend that you check the group settings and what information will be available before joining the group to ensure that you are happy with the information that is visible to others."]}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"3.2 Group Networks"}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["If you are a member of a group, this group may now or in the future become part of a network of groups known as a \u201c",r(d[6]).universityName," Pro\u201d network. Members who administer a ",r(d[6]).universityName," Pro network, known as \u201cnetwork administrators\u201d have access to the content within their groups. Network administrators find it helpful to have access to the email addresses of organizers and other members of groups within their networks, to easily communicate with and administer the groups. Therefore, we may ask if you want to share your email address with your group\u2019s network administrator."]}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"3.3 WeWork Locations"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"3.4 With Our Service Providers"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"We may use service providers in connection with operating and improving the Platform to assist with certain functions, such as payment processing, email transmission, conducting surveys or contests, data hosting, managing our ads, and some aspects of our technical and customer support. We take measures to ensure that these service providers access, process, and store information about you only for the purposes we authorize, subject to confidentiality obligations."}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:["3.5 Following the Law and Protecting ",r(d[6]).universityName]}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["We may access, preserve, and disclose information about you to third parties, including the content of messages, if we believe disclosure is in accordance with, or required by, applicable law, regulation, legal process, or audits. We may also disclose information about you if we believe that your actions are inconsistent with our Terms of Service or related guidelines and policies, or if necessary to protect the rights, property, or safety of, or prevent fraud or abuse of,"," ",r(d[6]).universityName," or others."]}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"3.6 Sharing and Other Tools"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"The Platform may offer sharing features and other integrated tools which let you share activities that you take on our Platform with third-party services, and vice versa. Such features let you share information with your contacts, depending on the settings you have chosen with the service. The third-party services' use of the information will be governed by the third-parties\u2019 privacy policies, and we do not control the third-parties\u2019 use of the shared data. For more information about the purpose and scope of data collection and processing in connection with social sharing features, please review the privacy policies of the services that provide these features."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"3.7 Affiliate Sharing and Merger, Sale, Or Other Asset Transfers"}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["If ",r(d[6]).universityName," is involved in a merger, acquisition, financing, reorganization, bankruptcy, or sale of our assets, information about you may be shared, sold, or transferred as part of that transaction. We may also share information about you with current or future corporate parents, subsidiaries, or affiliates."]}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"3.8 Other Situations"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"We may de-identify or aggregate information about you and share it freely, so that you can no longer be identified. We may also share information about you with your consent or at your direction or where we are legally entitled to do so."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"4. Additional Information"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"4.1 Analytics and Advertising Services Provided by Others"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"With your permission, we may allow others to use cookies, web beacons, device identifiers, and other technologies to collect information about your use of the Platform and other websites and online services. See ourCookie Policyfor details about these technologies and the information that they collect, use, or share, including how you may be able to control or disable these services."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"4.2 Security"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"We employ technical and organizational measures designed to appropriately protect your information that is under our control and that we process on your behalf from unauthorized access collection, use, disclosure, copying, modification or disposal, both during transmission and once we receive it. We store all information that you provide to us on secure servers. We train employees regarding our data privacy policies and procedures and permit authorized employees to access information on a need to know basis, as required for their role. We use firewalls designed to protect against intruders and test for network vulnerabilities. However, no method of transmission over the internet or method of electronic storage is completely secure. Where you have a password, which enables you to use our services, you are responsible for keeping this password complex, secure, and confidential. If you would like to update or change your password, you may select the \u201cForgot your password?\u201d link on the login page. You will be sent an email that allows you to reset your password."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"4.3 Data Retention"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"We may temporarily block your account if you have not logged in for six months or more. You may contact us if you wish to reactivate your account.We retain certain information that we collect from you while you are a member of the Platform, and in certain cases where you have deleted your account, for the following reasons: You can use our Platform; To ensure that we do not communicate with you if you have asked us not to; To provide you with a refund, if entitled; To provide accurate accounting information to other members about the groups that they organize or administer, and associated memberships; To better understand the traffic to our Platform so that we can provide all members with the best possible experience; To detect and prevent abuse of our Platform, illegal activities and breaches of our Terms of Service; and To comply with applicable legal, tax or accounting requirements. When we have no ongoing legitimate business need to process your information, we will either delete or anonymize it."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"4.4 Policy Scope"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"This Privacy Policy does not apply to information that you provide to third parties, such as other members, including group organizers and network administrators, and others with whom you may share information about you. Our Platform may direct you to a third-party service, such as social media services, or a portion of our Platform may be controlled by a third party (typically using a frame or pop-up window separate from other content on our Platform). Disclosure of information to these third parties is subject to the relevant third party\u2019s privacy policy. We are not responsible for the third-party privacy policy or content, even if we link to those services from our Platform or if we share information with these third parties. Members, including group organizers and network administrators, are directly responsible for complying with all requirements of applicable privacy laws as per their country in connection with the information that they obtain and process for the purposes of managing their contacts, or organizing groups, or administering networks"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"4.5 Revisions to This Policy"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"We may modify this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will provide notice to you by publishing the most current version and revising the date at the top of this page. If we make any material change to this policy, we will provide additional notice to you, such as by sending you an email or displaying a prominent notice on our Platform."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"4.5 Revisions to This Policy"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"We may modify this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will provide notice to you by publishing the most current version and revising the date at the top of this page. If we make any material change to this policy, we will provide additional notice to you, such as by sending you an email or displaying a prominent notice on our Platform."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"5. Your Choices"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"5.1 Your Choices: Account Information"}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["You may update or correct your account information by editing your account settings or by sending a request to privacy@",r(d[6]).universityName,".com as described inYou may deactivate your account by editing your account settings or by sending an email to privacy@",r(d[6]).universityName,".com. You will also be able to choose what information others see about you and who may contact you by using the Privacy Settings section in your Account."]}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"5.2 Your Choices: Location Information"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"When you first access the Platform, we will collect information about your location, which we use to make better recommendations for groups and events in your area, and to improve our Platform. If you do not want us to collect information about your location, then you can prevent this: If using a mobile app, by changing the settings on your device. If using our website, your location data will be obtained via a cookie. Please refer to our Cookie Policyfor additional information on how to manage our use of cookies."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"Note that our Platform or its features may no longer function properly if you do."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"Your mobile device settings may also give you the option to choose whether to allow us to view your location on a continuous basis, when only using the app, or never. Allowing us to view your location when you are not using the app allows us to provide you with recommendations on a regular basis. Please refer to your device\u2019s guide for additional information on how to adjust location services."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"5.3 Your Choices: Cookies"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"We may use and allow others to use cookies, web beacons, device identifiers, and other technologies to collect information about your use of the Platform and other websites and online services. See ourCookie Policyfor details about these technologies and the information that they collect, use, or share, including how you may be able to control or disable these services."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"5.4 Your Choices: Promotional Communications"}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["You can control messages that you receive from ",r(d[6]).universityName,", other members, and third parties by selecting the unsubscribe link in the message that you receive, or by adjusting the communication preferences in your account settings. We will also send you a link to these settings when you first sign up and in subsequent messages. If you opt out, we may still send you non-promotional messages, such as those about your account or our ongoing business relations."]}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"6. Data Rights"}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["We respond to all requests that we receive from individuals who wish to exercise their data protection rights in accordance with applicable data protection laws. You can contact us by sending an email to privacy@",r(d[6]).universityName,".com."]}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"Rights that you may have, depending on the country in which you live, include:"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"Accessing, correcting, updating, or requesting deletion of your information."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"Objecting to processing of your information, asking us to restrict processing of your information, or requesting the portability of your information."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"Opting out from receiving marketing communications that we send you at any time. You can exercise this right by selecting the \u201cunsubscribe\u201d or \u201copt-out\u201d link in the marketing emails we send you. Additionally, you may update your email preferences by changing the settings in your account."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"Withdrawing your consent at any time if we have collected and processed your information with your consent. Withdrawing your consent will not affect the lawfulness of any processing that we conducted prior to your withdrawal, nor will it affect processing of your information conducted in reliance on lawful processing grounds other than consent."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"Complaining to a data protection authority about our collection and use of your information. For more information, please contact your local data protection authority. Contact details for data protection authorities in the Indian Subcontinent are available here."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"Other members, such as group organizers and network administrators, may also act as controllers of your information. You should contact these members if you have any questions about how they use information that you have provided to them."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subsection,children:"7. Contact Us"}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["Under Indian Subcontinent data protection law, the controller of your information is ",r(d[6]).universityName,", Inc.If you have any questions or complaints about this Privacy Policy or how we use your information, please contact privacy@",r(d[6]).universityName,".com."]}),(0,s.jsx)(o.View,{style:{marginTop:20}})]})]})},function(t){return o.StyleSheet.create({container:{flex:1},content:{paddingHorizontal:16,paddingVertical:20},title:{fontSize:20,fontWeight:"bold",marginBottom:12,color:t.textColor},subtitle:{fontSize:18,fontWeight:"600",marginTop:16,marginBottom:8,color:t.textColor},subsection:{fontSize:16,fontWeight:"500",marginTop:10,marginBottom:6,color:t.textColor},text:{fontSize:14,lineHeight:22,marginBottom:10,color:t.textColor}})})},2095,[1,2,72,1166,241,526,558]);
__d(function(g,r,i,a,m,e,d){var t=r(d[0]);Object.defineProperty(e,"__esModule",{value:!0}),e.default=void 0;var o=r(d[1]),n=(t(r(d[2])),t(r(d[3]))),s=r(d[4]),l=(e.default=function(t){var u=t.navigation,c=(0,r(d[5]).useTheme)(),h=(c.isDark,c.colors),y=(c.toggleTheme,l(h));return(0,s.jsxs)(o.SafeAreaView,{style:y.container,children:[(0,s.jsx)(n.default,{title:"Terms",navigation:u}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.ScrollView,{style:y.content,showsVerticalScrollIndicator:!1,children:[(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.title,children:"Terms of Service Overview"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"Below is an overview of our Terms of Service for our \u201cPlatform\u201d, which means any website, application, or service we offer. You should read the complete Terms of Service because that document (and not this overview) is our legally binding agreement. The Terms of Service includes information about your legal rights and covers areas such as automatic subscription renewals, limitations of liability, resolution of disputes by mandatory arbitration rather than a judge or jury in a court of law, and a class action waiver."}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.subtitle,children:["Your Relationship with ",r(d[6]).universityName]}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["1. By using our Platform, you are agreeing to our Terms of Service. That is a legally binding agreement between you and ",r(d[6]).universityName,"."]}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"2. If you break the rules, we may suspend or terminate your account."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"3. We charge for certain aspects of our Platform, and some of these fees are billed on a regular and recurring basis (unless you disable auto-renewal or cancel your subscription)."}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.subtitle,children:[r(d[6]).universityName," Groups, Organizers and Members"]}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["1. Organizers may establishmembership criteriafor their own"," ",r(d[6]).universityName," groups. Whilethere is probably a ",r(d[6]).universityName," ","group out there for everyone, not every ",r(d[6]).universityName," group is for you. If you can\u2019t find the right group, you can easily start your own",r(d[6]).universityName," group."]}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"2. Organizers may charge fees for memberships or events."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"3. Using our Platform involves meeting real people and doing real things in the real world, which can sometimes lead to unexpected situations. We can\u2019t control what happens in the real world, andwe are not responsible for it. You should use common sense and good judgment when interacting with others."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subtitle,children:"Your Content and Content of Others"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"1. You are responsible for your \u201cContent\u201d, which means any information, material, or other content posted to our Platform. Your Content must comply with our Terms of Service, which includes theUsage and Content Policies, Group Policies, Member Restrictions, Payment Policies etc. Your Content is also subject to our Intellectual Property Dispute Policies."}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["2. We do not own the Content that you post. However, we do require thatyou provide us a license to use this Content for us to operate, improve, promote, and protect ",r(d[6]).universityName," and our Platform for the benefit of you and others."]}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"3. We are not responsible for Content that members post or the communications that members send using our Platform."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"4. We generally don\u2019t review Content before it\u2019s posted. If you see Content that violates our Terms of Service, you may report inappropriate Content to us."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subtitle,children:"Our Platform"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"1. We try hard to make sure that our Platform is always available and working, but we cannot guarantee it will be. Occasionally things may not go exactly as planned. We apologize in advance for any inconvenience."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"2. We are continually improving our Platform. This means that we may modify or discontinue portions of our Platform."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"3. By using our Platform, you agree to the limitations of liability and release in our Terms of Service. Except as specified in our Terms of Service, you also agree to resolve any disputes you may have with us through arbitration, and you are waiving your right to seek relief from a judge or jury in a court of law, except as otherwise provided for in the Terms of Service. Claims can only be brought individually, and not as part of a class action."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.title,children:"Terms of Service"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subtitle,children:"1. The Agreement"}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:[r(d[6]).universityName," enables you and other members to arrange off-line, real-world ",r(d[6]).universityName," groups and ",r(d[6]).universityName," events. The terms \u201c",r(d[6]).universityName,",\u201d \u201cwe,\u201d \u201cus,\u201d and \u201cour\u201d include"," ",r(d[6]).universityName,", Inc. and our affiliates. We use the terms \u201cyou\u201d and \u201cyour\u201d to mean any person using our Platform, and any organization or person using the Platform on an organization\u2019s behalf. We use the word \u201cPlatform\u201d to mean any website, application, or service offered by"," ",r(d[6]).universityName,", including content we offer and electronic communications we send. We provide our Platform to you subject to these Terms of Service.","\n"," We use the terms \u201cTerms of Service\u201d and \u201cAgreement\u201d interchangeably to mean this document together with our Usage and Content Policies, Group Policies etc. Your use of the Platform signifies that you agree to this Agreement. ","\n","If you are using the Platform for an organization, you agree to this Agreement on behalf of that organization, and represent you have authority to bind that organization to the terms contained in this Agreement. If you do not or are unable to agree to this Agreement, do not use our Platform."]}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subtitle,children:"1.1 Revisions to this Agreement"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"We may modify this Agreement from time to time. When we do, we will provide notice to you by publishing the most current version and revising the date at the top of this page. If we make any material change to this Agreement, we will provide additional notice to you, such as by sending you an email or displaying a prominent notice on our Platform. By continuing to use the Platform after any changes come into effect, you agree to the revised Agreement."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subtitle,children:"2. Your Account and Membership"}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["2.1 Eligibility-: Our Platform is available to anyone who is at least 18 years old. You represent that you are at least 18. Additional eligibility requirements for a portion of our Platform may be set by any member who can moderate or manage that portion of our Platform. For example, the eligibility requirements for a ",r(d[6]).universityName," group or",r(d[6]).universityName," event may be set by the organizers of that group."]}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["2.2 Suspension of Your Account-:We may modify, suspend or terminate your account or access to the Platform if, in our sole discretion, we determine that you have violated this Agreement, including any of the policies or guidelines that are part of this Agreement, that it is in the best interest of the ",r(d[6]).universityName," community, or to protect our brand or Platform. We also may remove accounts of members who are inactive for an extended period.","\n"," A member who can moderate or manage a portion of our Platform also has the ability, in his or her sole discretion, to modify, suspend, or terminate your access to that portion of the Platform."]}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["2.3 Account Information and Security -: When you register, you provide us with some basic information, including an email address and a password. Keep your email address and other account information current and accurate. Also, you agree to maintain the security and confidentiality of your password (or else we may need to disable your account).","\n"," You alone are responsible for anything that happens from your failure to maintain that security and confidentiality, such as by sharing your account credentials with others. If someone is using your password, notify us immediately."]}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subtitle,children:"3. Fees, Payments and Offers"}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["3.1Fees Charged by ",r(d[6]).universityName," -: Use of some of the features on our Platform is free, and we charge fees for other features. We may in the future implement a new fee, or modify an existing fee, for certain current or future features of our Platform. If we implement a new or modified fee, we will give you advanced notice such as by posting changes on our Platform or sending you an email.","\n","You agree to pay those fees and any associated taxes for your continued use of the applicable service. Unless otherwise stated, all fees and all transactions are in U.S. dollars. All fees are exclusive of applicable federal, state, local, or other taxes. Organizer subscriptions are non-transferable."]}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subtitle,children:"4. Your Content and Privacy"}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["4.1 Your Content -: You are solely responsible for your Content. We use the word \u201cContent\u201d to mean any information, material, or other content posted to our Platform or otherwise provide to us (such as feedback, comments, or suggestions shared with us). You agree that you and your Content shall not violate the rights of any third party (such as copyrights, trademarks, contract rights, privacy rights, or publicity rights),","\n","this Agreement (including ourUsage and Content Policies, Group Policies, , Member Restrictions, and Intellectual Property Policies)"]}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["4.2 Content License from You -: We do not claim ownership of your Content. However, to enable us to operate, improve, promote, and protect ",r(d[6]).universityName," and our Platform, and to ensure we do not violate any rights you may have in your Content, you hereby grant"," ",r(d[6]).universityName," a non-exclusive, worldwide, perpetual, irrevocable, royalty-free, sublicensable, transferable right and license (including a waiver of any moral rights) to use, host, store, reproduce, modify, publish, publicly display, publicly perform, distribute, and create derivative works of, your Content and to commercialize and exploit the copyright, trademark, publicity, and database rights you have in your Content."]}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["4.3 Privacy-: ",r(d[6]).universityName," collects registration and other information about you through our Platform. Please refer to our Privacy Policy and Cookie Policy for details on how we collect, use, and disclose this information. These policies do not govern use of information that you provide to third parties, such as other members of ",r(d[6]).universityName,"\u2019s Platform."]}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subtitle,children:"5. Your Use of Our Platform"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"5.1 Our Policies, Guidelines and Applicable Laws -: When you use our Platform, we require that you follow the Usage and Content Policies, Member Restrictions, Payment Policies etc. You also agree to comply with all applicable laws, rules and regulations, and to not violate or infringe the rights of any third party. If you do not comply, we may modify, suspend or terminate your account or access to the Platform, in our sole discretion."}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["5.2 Content of Others -: ",r(d[6]).universityName," does not control the Content of other members. When we become aware of inappropriate Content on our Platform, we reserve the right to investigate and take appropriate action, but we do not have any obligation to monitor, nor do we take responsibility for, the Content of other members."]}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["5.3 Interactions with Others -: ",r(d[6]).universityName," is not a party to any offline arrangements made through our Platform. ",r(d[6]).universityName," does not conduct or require background checks on members and does not attempt to verify the truth or accuracy of statements made by members.",r(d[6]).universityName," makes no representations or warranties concerning the conduct or Content of any members or their interactions with you."]}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"5.4 No Resale -: Our Platform contains proprietary and confidential information and is protected by intellectual property laws. Unless we expressly permit it through this Agreement, you agree not to modify, reproduce, sell or charge a fee, offer to sell or charge a fee, make, create derivative works based on, or distribute any part of our Platform, including any data, or Content of others."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"5.5 No Technical Interference with the Platform -: You agree that you will not engage in any activity or post any information or material that interferes with or disrupts, or that is designed to interfere with or disrupt, the Platform or any hardware used in connection with the Platform."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"5.6 Platform Modifications -: We work hard to continuously improve our Platform. This means that we may modify or discontinue portions or all our Platform with or without notice and without liability to you or any third party."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subtitle,children:"6.Release"}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["You agree to release us and our officers, directors, shareholders, agents, employees, consultants, affiliates, subsidiaries, sponsors, and other third-party partners (referred to in this Agreement as \u201c",r(d[6]).universityName," Parties\u201d) from claims, demands, and damages (direct and consequential) of every kind and nature, known and unknown, now and in the future (referred to in this Agreement as \u201cClaims\u201d), arising out of or in any way connected with any transaction with a third party, your interactions with other members, or in connection with a"," ",r(d[6]).universityName,"group or a ",r(d[6]).universityName," event.","\n","You also agree to release organizers from Claims based on an organizer\u2019s negligence arising out of or in any way connected with their Content, a ",r(d[6]).universityName," ","group, or a ",r(d[6]).universityName," event.","\n","You further waive all rights and benefits otherwise conferred by any statutory or non-statutory law of any jurisdiction that would purport to limit the scope of a release or waiver. You waive and relinquish all rights and benefits that you have or may have under any similar provision of statutory or non-statutory law of any other jurisdiction fully permitted by law."]}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subtitle,children:"7. Warranty Disclaimer and Limitation of Liability"}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"7.1 Warranty Disclaimer -: Our Platform is provided to you \u201cas is\u201d and on an \u201cas available\u201d basis. We disclaim all warranties and conditions of any kind, including but not limited to statutory warranties, and the implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a purpose, and non-infringement. We also disclaim any warranties regarding (a) the reliability, timeliness, accuracy, and performance of our Platform, (b) any information, advice, services, or goods obtained through or advertised on our Platform or by us, as well as for any information or advice received through any links to other websites or resources provided through our Platform, (c) the results that may be obtained from the Platform, and (d) the correction of any errors in the Platform, (e) any material or data obtained through the use of our Platform, and (f) dealings with or as the result of the presence of marketing partners or other third parties on or located through our Platform."}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["7.2 Limitation of Liability -: You agree that in no event shall any",r(d[6]).universityName," Parties be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages, including but not limited to, damages for loss of profits, goodwill, use, data, or other intangible losses (even if any ",r(d[6]).universityName," Parties have been advised of the possibility of such damages) arising out of or in connection with (a) our Platform or this Agreement or the inability to use our Platform (however arising, including our negligence), (b) statements or conduct of or transactions with any member or third party on the Platform, (c) your use of our Platform or transportation to or from ",r(d[6]).universityName,"events, attendance at ",r(d[6]).universityName," events, participation in or exclusion from ",r(d[6]).universityName," groups or ",r(d[6]).universityName," events and the actions of you or others at ",r(d[6]).universityName," events, or (d) any other matter relating to the Platform."]}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subtitle,children:"8. Dispute Resolution"}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["8.1 Informal Resolution -: Before making any claim, you and"," ",r(d[6]).universityName," agree to try to resolve any disputes through good faith discussions. We use the term \u201cclaim\u201d to mean any dispute, claim or controversy arising out of or relating to your use of our Platform or this Agreement, including your participation in ",r(d[6]).universityName," ","events. You or ",r(d[6]).universityName," may initiate this process by sending written notice describing the dispute and your proposed resolution. If we cannot resolve the issue within 30 business days of receipt of the initial notice, you or ",r(d[6]).universityName," may bring a claim in accordance"]}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["8.2 Arbitration Agreement -: you agree to submit any claim for final and binding arbitration. In arbitration certain rights that you or we would have in court may not be available, such as discovery or appeal. You and ",r(d[6]).universityName," are each expressly waiving any right to trial by judge or jury in a court of law. This agreement to arbitrate shall apply regardless of whether the claim arises during or after any termination of this Agreement or your relationship with"," ",r(d[6]).universityName,"."]}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"8.3 Arbitration Time for Filing-:Any claim subject to arbitration must be filed within one year after the date the party asserting the claim first knows or should know of the act, omission or default giving rise to the claim, or the shortest time permitted by applicable law."}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["8.4 Arbitration Procedures-:Either party may commence arbitration by filing a written demand for arbitration with ",r(d[6]).universityName,", with a copy to the other party according to the notice procedures in Section 10.1 The arbitration will be conducted in accordance with"," ",r(d[6]).universityName," Streamlined Arbitration Rules and Procedures and any other applicable rules that ",r(d[6]).universityName," requires (\u201c",r(d[6]).universityName," Rules\u201d) in effect as of the demand for arbitration. You agree that arbitration law govern the interpretation and enforcement of these arbitration provisions. Any arbitration hearings can take place anywhere in the world.","\n","It isyour responsibility to pay any filing, administrative and arbitrator fees will be solely as set forth in the ",r(d[6]).universityName,"Rules. The parties will cooperate with ",r(d[6]).universityName," and each other in scheduling the arbitration proceedings, and in selecting one arbitrator from the appropriate ",r(d[6]).universityName," list with substantial experience in resolving intellectual property and contract disputes. The arbitrator shall follow this Agreement and, to the extent permitted by ",r(d[6]).universityName," Rules, can award costs, fees and expenses, including attorneys\u2019 fees to the prevailing party, except that the arbitrator shall not award declaratory or injunctive relief benefiting anyone but the parties to the arbitration. Judgment upon the award rendered by such arbitrator may be entered in any court of competent jurisdiction."]}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["8.5 Exceptions -: You or ",r(d[6]).universityName," may assert claims, if they qualify, in small claims court, You or ",r(d[6]).universityName," may seek injunctive relief from a court of competent jurisdiction as necessary to protect the intellectual property rights of you or ",r(d[6]).universityName,"pending the completion of arbitration.","\n",r(d[6]).universityName," may act in court or arbitration to collect any fees or recover damages for, or to seek injunctive relief relating to, Platform operations, or unauthorized use of our Platform or intellectual property. Nothing in this Section 9 shall diminish"," ",r(d[6]).universityName,"\u2019s right to modify, suspend or terminate your account or access to our Platform under Section 2.2."]}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["8.6 Class Action Waiver -: You agree to resolve disputes with"," ",r(d[6]).universityName," on an individual basis. You agree not to bring a claim as a plaintiff or a class member in a class, consolidated or representative action. You are expressly waiving any right to participate in class actions, class arbitrations, private attorney general actions and consolidation with other arbitrations."]}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subtitle,children:"9. Intellectual Property"}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["9.1 Intellectual Propertyof ",r(d[6]).universityName," -: ",r(d[6]).universityName," ","trademarks, logos, service marks, and service names are the intellectual property of ",r(d[6]).universityName,". Our Trademark Usage Guidelines explain how you may and may not use them. Our Platform, including our material on the Platform, are also our or our licensors\u2019 intellectual property, and as otherwise permitted by law, you agree not to use our intellectual property without our prior written consent."]}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["9.2 Intellectual Property of Others -: ",r(d[6]).universityName," respects the intellectual property of others, and we expect our members to do the same. We may, in appropriate circumstances and in our discretion, remove or disable access to material that infringes on the intellectual property rights of others. We may also restrict or terminate access to our Platform to those who we believe to be repeat infringers. If you believe your intellectual property rights have been violated, please review our Intellectual Property Dispute Policies."]}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.subtitle,children:"10. Other Stuff"}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["10.1 Notices -: Except as otherwise stated in this Agreement or as expressly required by law, any notice to us shall be given by certified postal mail to a given address, or by email to legal@",r(d[6]).universityName,".com. Any notice to you shall be given to the most current email address in your account."]}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"10.2 Termination-: If we terminate your account or access to our Platform, this Agreement terminates with respect to the member account that has been terminated. However, certain provisions of this Agreement that by their nature survive termination"}),(0,s.jsxs)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:["10.3 Violations -: Please report any violations of this Agreement by a member or third party by sending an email to abuse@",r(d[6]).universityName,".com"]}),(0,s.jsx)(o.Text,{style:y.text,children:"10.4 Thank you -: Please accept our wholehearted thanks for reading our Terms of Service."}),(0,s.jsx)(o.View,{style:{marginTop:20}})]})]})},function(t){return o.StyleSheet.create({container:{flex:1,backgroundColor:t.background},content:{paddingHorizontal:16,paddingVertical:20},title:{fontSize:20,fontWeight:"bold",marginBottom:12,color:t.textColor},subtitle:{fontSize:18,fontWeight:"600",marginTop:16,marginBottom:8,color:t.textColor},subsection:{fontSize:16,fontWeight:"500",marginTop:10,marginBottom:6,color:t.textColor},text:{fontSize:14,lineHeight:22,marginBottom:10,color:t.textColor}})})},2096,[1,2,72,1166,241,526,558]);
